 # Ethernet MTU (jumbo frames). Default: unset, the MTU stays 1500 (or what DHCP sends). The EMAC
 # takes frames up to 2044 bytes in one descriptor, so the kernel caps end0 at MTU 2018
 # (harness/research/impl-emac-jumbo.md). Every host on the segment must use the same MTU.
